ot on CGI  most of what we saw was CGI but what's  really interesting about Australia is  that it has a lot of different terrains  it has jungles it has deserts but it  also has the ocean this is something  that Atlanta does not have because you  have to wonder why they're not shooting  it in Atlanta again the first one was a  massive success and other Marvel movies  are shooting in Atlanta currently in  fact guardians of the galaxy vol 3 which  we're going to talk about in just a bit  is filming in Atlanta as well so why is  black panther 2 filming in australia and  it's just speculation on my behalf right  now  I think it's because of the ocean and  why do they need the ocean because blacc  panther2 is going to involve Namor now  of course they use underwater tanks and  a lot of CGI for underwater scenes but  if you're going to have a film that is  going to heavily involve an underwater  group of people you're probably going to  show large bodies of water a lot and you  don't have that in Atlanta and you don't  want a CGI an ocean so you have the  ocean but then again you also have all  of the other scenery that you need to  make the film look like it is shot in  Africa now remember the writers of  Avengers endgame did confirm that they  did put a name or easter egg in the  movie they said sometimes you plant  seeds sometimes they grow hinting that  name wars debut is right around the  corner and again it's just speculation  but to me it seems like they're choosing  Australia to shoot black panther 2 at  because of the ocean around it which if  true definitely means that Namor is  going to be in black panther 2 which he  is a rumored to be now the production  summary doesn't say anything about it  because they know that these get out it  just says more adventures with T'Challa  the king of Wakanda aka the black  panther but I firmly believe that Namor  is going to be in black panther 2 and  then we have a production grid for the  guardians of the galaxy vol 3 they plan  to start shooting in February 2000 21  February first in Atlanta Georgia now  this is great news because we didn't  really know too much about guardians of  the galaxy vol 3 it was actually  supposed to be in phase 4 but of course  James Gunn got fired and then rehired  and got brought on to do the new Suicide  Squad and can't work on guardians of the  galaxy 3 until he finishes that so we  don't have a release date for guardians  3 but it starts filming one month before  black panther 2 starts filming and black  panther 2 comes out in May of 2022 so  that means we could probably expect  guardians to come out early 2022 or late  2022 and hopefully finally get that  debut of Adam warlock that was teased at  the end in the post-credits scene of  guardians vol 2 but this is great news  because the pandemic is dying down just  a little bit movie theaters are slowly  starting to open back up and production  at studios are starting to kick up again  so that means that Marvel seems pretty  confident in their phase for release  date schedule and hopefully we'll find  out more about phase 5 soon so let me  know what you think about this awesome  news in the comments down below and  don't forget to like the video and  subscribe so you can  stay up to date on everything relating  to the MCU for live updates you can  follow me on Twitter and as always thank  you all so much for watching  woof woof
 

